      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的脚步比我预料的还要快。\n我本来以为她赶不上经典赛，该不会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f0a75354aed11faf74a6befed7f9876add3a2280c8a9b81a7a6f42568aa4a8e",
